.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH sqop-revoke-key 1 "February 2025" "sqop 0.38.0" 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sqop\-revoke\-key \- Creates a Revocation Certificate
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBsqop revoke\-key\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-armor\fR] [\fB\-\-with\-key\-password\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Creates a Revocation Certificate.
.PP
Generate a revocation certificate for each Transferable Secret Key found.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Emit verbose output for debugging
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-armor\fR
Don\*(Aqt ASCII\-armor output
.TP
\fB\-\-with\-key\-password\fR \fI<WITH_KEY_PASSWORD>\fR
Unlock the keys with these passwords
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
